<%# The episodes of the podcast, or the tracks of the release, this post
    belongs to or this page is connected to (`podcast:` / `release:`), as a
    collapsible playlist the page's player plays through. Episodic shows run
    newest first, serial shows oldest first, releases in track order. Only
    for two or more. Skipped when the body has a playlist of its own. %>
<% connected = kind == "post" ? record.post_type.in?(%w[podcast music]) : kind == "page" %>
<% if connected && (playlist = record.series_playlist_html).present? %>
  <div class="post-playlist"><%= playlist.html_safe %></div>
<% end %>
